  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 9e49b409e06509444a7f6f975ec945e8, type: 3}
  m_Name: PopUpMessages
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  popupData:
  - <PopUpText>k__BackingField: You've hit a population milestone!\n\nA new Power
      Plant can be built.
  - <PopUpText>k__BackingField: You've hit a population milestone!\n\nA new building
      has been unlocked.\n\nShops give a mood bonus when placed next to each other.
  - <PopUpText>k__BackingField: You've hit a population milestone!\n\nA new building
      has been unlocked.\n\nParks increase mood when near apartments.
  - <PopUpText>k__BackingField: You've hit a population milestone!\n\nA new building
      has been unlocked.\n\nHouses cost more power, but increase mood more.
  - <PopUpText>k__BackingField: Power is required for all buildings!\n\nClick the
      lightning bolts as they appear to get more power.
  - <PopUpText>k__BackingField: You've hit a population milestone!\n\nA new building
      has been unlocked.\n\nLandfills can drastically reduce the mood when placed
      poorly.
  - <PopUpText>k__BackingField: Game Over!\n\nYour population has become too unhappy!\n\nThanks
      for playing!
  - <PopUpText>k__BackingField: Your population is very unhappy! They will leave
      soon if you don't increase their mood!
  - <PopUpText>k__BackingField: Power to the People! can be controlled exclusively
      with the mouse.\n\nYou must build up your population while keeping them happy.\n\nThe
      meters in the bottom right indicate their current needs.
